name=Axion Super Power Saving
version=v3.7.12
versionCode=70
author=Axion SPSM
description=v3.7.12, from the owner's v3.7.11 log: the built-in three-button navigation now truly follows the power-saving home (a stale saved preference had silenced it - the option is gone, its old off value no longer counts); the launcher and every HOME-capable app are never suspended, which ends the false drift and the safety valves on every exit; the exit's last wide-open fan is bounded (the 103-second revert becomes seconds); and a full code audit removed the dead paths (the Low-Power write path, unused helpers and wrappers, the app's unused state map). Suite: 623 checks, 0 failed, twice.
